			"notes": "### Changes/Additions\n- Migrated to Quilt toolchain\n- Added compatibility with Space Walker's [Kabo Village Marker Mod port](https://modrinth.com/mod/kabo-village-marker)\n- Added projectile and tnt loggers\n- New rules:\n  - `instantFall` - Causes gravity-affected blocks to fall instantly\n  - `instantScheduling` - Instantly executes scheduled ticks\n  - `saveUnloadChunks` - Enables chunk unloading when the world is saved"
