			"notes": "### Changes/Additions\n- Migrated to Ornithe's [loom](https://github.com/OrnitheMC/ornithe-loom) and [loader](https://github.com/OrnitheMC/ornithe-loader)\n- `tapestry.conf` will now be created inside the `config` folder\n- Rules listed by the `tap` command will now appear in alphabetical order\n- Added a mobcap logger\n- New rules:\n    - `bottleFillCauldron` - Enables filling cauldrons with water bottles\n    - `placeFilledCauldron` - Placing a cauldron named with a number will cause it to get that number as fill level\n    - `randomTickSpeed` - Sets the random tick speed\n    - `tcpNoDelay` - Forces connections to send small packets immediately instead of buffering them, reducing latency in some cases"
		},
